pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$bg"
elements:
  - elementId: kicker
    elementType: text
    bounds: [56, 52, 400, 14]
    content:
      style: "$kick"
      wrap: false
      text: 01 / 洞察 INSIGHT
  - elementId: statement
    elementType: text
    bounds: [56, 116, 440, 200]
    content:
      style: "$h1"
      fontSize: 31
      lineHeight: 1.4
      text: |
        <p>剪完的那一刻，</p>
        <p>没有人告诉他</p>
        <p>还缺哪一镜。</p>
  - elementId: lead
    elementType: text
    bounds: [56, 330, 420, 90]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      text: 叙光集从这一刻开始：把成片逐镜头读一遍，指出观众会在哪里看不懂，并给出能在现场执行的补拍与重剪动作。
  - elementId: quote
    elementType: text
    bounds: [56, 452, 420, 20]
    content:
      fontSize: 12
      color: "$goldsoft"
      fontFamily: {latin: Liter, ea: MiSans}
      italic: true
      wrap: false
      text: 观众只看一遍。
  - elementId: r-line-0
    elementType: line
    bounds: [540, 120, 364, 1]
    viewBox: [364, 1]
    points: "0,0.5 364,0.5"
    curve: sharp
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: r1-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [540, 136, 48, 24]
    content:
      fontSize: 18
      color: "$gold"
      fontFamily: Liter
      bold: true
      wrap: false
      text: "01"
  - elementId: r1-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [600, 138, 304, 22]
    content:
      fontSize: 15
      color: "$ink"
      fontFamily: {latin: Liter, ea: MiSans}
      bold: true
      wrap: false
      text: 衔接靠感觉
  - elementId: r1-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [600, 162, 304, 44]
    content:
      fontSize: 11
      color: "$sub"
      fontFamily: {latin: Liter, ea: MiSans}
      lineHeight: 1.6
      text: 剪得好不好、交代清不清楚，只能等发布之后自己猜。
  - elementId: r-line-1
    elementType: line
    bounds: [540, 216, 364, 1]
    viewBox: [364, 1]
    points: "0,0.5 364,0.5"
    curve: sharp
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: r2-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [540, 232, 48, 24]
    content:
      fontSize: 18
      color: "$gold"
      fontFamily: Liter
      bold: true
      wrap: false
      text: "02"
  - elementId: r2-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [600, 234, 304, 22]
    content:
      fontSize: 15
      color: "$ink"
      fontFamily: {latin: Liter, ea: MiSans}
      bold: true
      wrap: false
      text: 反馈落不了地
  - elementId: r2-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [600, 258, 304, 44]
    content:
      fontSize: 11
      color: "$sub"
      fontFamily: {latin: Liter, ea: MiSans}
      lineHeight: 1.6
      text: 「节奏有点怪」「内容有点散」，都对，但没说改哪一秒。
  - elementId: r-line-2
    elementType: line
    bounds: [540, 312, 364, 1]
    viewBox: [364, 1]
    points: "0,0.5 364,0.5"
    curve: sharp
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: r3-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [540, 328, 48, 24]
    content:
      fontSize: 18
      color: "$gold"
      fontFamily: Liter
      bold: true
      wrap: false
      text: "03"
  - elementId: r3-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [600, 330, 304, 22]
    content:
      fontSize: 15
      color: "$ink"
      fontFamily: {latin: Liter, ea: MiSans}
      bold: true
      wrap: false
      text: 补拍靠记忆
  - elementId: r3-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [600, 354, 304, 44]
    content:
      fontSize: 11
      color: "$sub"
      fontFamily: {latin: Liter, ea: MiSans}
      lineHeight: 1.6
      text: 回到现场想不起景别、朝向和秒数，补一次拍废一次。
  - elementId: r-line-3
    elementType: line
    bounds: [540, 408, 364, 1]
    viewBox: [364, 1]
    points: "0,0.5 364,0.5"
    curve: sharp
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: foot-line
    elementType: line
    bounds: [56, 500, 848, 1]
    viewBox: [848, 1]
    points: "0,0.5 848,0.5"
    curve: sharp
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: foot-l
    elementType: text
    bounds: [56, 508, 400, 12]
    content:
      style: "$foot"
      wrap: false
      text: 叙光集 LUMENARRATIVE
  - elementId: foot-r
    elementType: text
    bounds: [504, 508, 400, 12]
    content:
      style: "$foot"
      align: [right, top]
      wrap: false
      text: 02 / 12
